\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"heading-divider\"><\/div>\n\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"heading-description-wrap\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"heading-description\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>China-ASEAN Studies Centre (CASC) serves as a critical platform to advance mutual understanding, co-develop policy solutions, and strengthen people-to-people ties for a peaceful, stable, and prosperous region.<\/p>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa65b39 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fa65b39\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The primary objectives of the China-ASEAN Studies Centre are:<br \/>\u2022 Promote Dialogue and Consultation: Foster open communication and constructive dialogue among policymakers, scholars, and civil society from China and ASEAN member states to address shared challenges and opportunities.<br \/>\u2022 Enhance Mutual Trust and Understanding: Build bridges of understanding and trust between diverse stakeholders to promote mutual respect, cultural exchange, and closer cooperation.<br \/>\u2022 Facilitate Policy Solutions: Co-create and co-develop innovative, evidence-based policy solutions to address pressing regional issues such as peace, security, development, and governance. <br \/>\u2022 Strengthen People-to-People Ties: Cultivate a deeper sense of community through cultural exchanges, academic collaborations, and shared learning opportunities.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-705cf7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"705cf7e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spac