ons, and strengthen people-to-people ties for a peaceful, stable, and prosperous region. The primary objectives of the China-ASEAN Studies Centre are:\u2022 Promote Dialogue and Consultation: Foster open communication and constructive dialogue among policymakers, scholars, and civil society from China and ASEAN member states to address shared challenges and opportunities.\u2022 Enhance Mutual Trust and Understanding: Build bridges of understanding and trust between diverse stakeholders to promote mutual respect, cultural exchange, and closer cooperation.\u2022 Facilitate Policy Solutions: Co-create and co-develop innovative, evidence-based policy solutions to address pressing regional issues such as peace, security, development, and governance. \u2022 Strengthen People-to-People Ties: Cultivate a deeper sense of community through cultural exchanges, academic collaborations, and shared learning opportunities. CONTACT Prof. Dr. Vannarith ChheangDirector of China-ASEAN Studies Centre (CASC)E-mail: vannarith.chheang@camtech.edu.kh Research and Publication<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5672","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5672","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5672"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/5672\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":37012,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/w